# registry.confium.org
#
# This file configures the custom domain for the GitHub Pages site. The line
# below is the apex/CNAME value GitHub expects. It is left UNCOMMENTED so that
# once DNS is configured (an A/ALIAS record pointing at GitHub Pages IPs) the
# site will resolve. Until DNS is set up, the site is reachable at the default
# *.github.io URL.
#
# To switch the site back to the default github.io URL temporarily, comment
# this line out (or delete the file) and republish.
registry.confium.org
